# --- Restricted course material -------------------------------------------
# The course PDFs are marked Restricted: never commit them.
# PDFs are ignored everywhere; if the team ever needs to commit one of its
# own PDFs (e.g. an exported diagram), add it explicitly with `git add -f`.
*.pdf

